        "prompt": "Find the relationship between $h$ and $r$, given the semivertical angle in each case below. Hence, express the volume of the cone in terms of $h$ only.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [
          {
            "id": "p20-q4-diagram",
